{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And killed five hundred men.</b> The verb form is like הנה לא ידעתי דבר. The sages of Spain rejoiced over the meaning of ארידתא and likewise פורתא, and they are those who rejoice over nothing, for these names are Persian, not Hebrew."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:19.239923928Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}